<title>FRANCE: Rouen Feb 1-19 flour exports 26,874 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Feb 1-19 flour exports 26,874 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 26,874 tonnes between February 1 and February 19, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 67,000 tonnes for the whole of February 1996.</p>
<p>February 1-19 exports included 21,774 tonnes for Yemen and 5,100 tonnes for west Africa.</p>
<p>One ship was also loading 20,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen destined for Yemen. Another vessel was loading an unspecified tonnage of flour destined for Eritrea, they said.</p>
</text>
